<title>UK: UK M0 grows provisional s/a 7.5 pct in year to Nov.</title>
<headline>UK M0 grows provisional s/a 7.5 pct in year to Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following provisional data on M0 money supply -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY (in pct)	   Nov		  Oct</p>
<p>    M0 in month (adjusted)	 +0.9		  +0.7</p>
<p>    M0 annual (adjusted)	   +7.5		  +7.5</p>
<p>    M0 in month (unadjusted) +0.8	    0.0</p>
<p>    M0 annual (unadjusted)	 +7.3		  +7.5</p>
<p>NOTE - consensus forecast +7.5 pct yr/yr s/adj growth.</p>
</text>
